87890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"并得这么紧。\n是不是不知道，双腿这样用力摩擦，只会让中间那个地方变得更敏感。\n刚才乱蹭的时候，那里是不是已经磨出水了。","timestamp":1789292570607,"time":"18:42","_id":17194},{"id":1791059430352,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"既然不打算让我轻易吃掉。\n那我就花一整夜的时间，不仅把你吃下去，还要把你一点一点舔干净。","timestamp":1789292571476,"time":"18:42","_id":17195},{"id":1791059430353,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"现在，把腿张好。\n不许合上。","timestamp":1789292572347,"time":"18:42","_id":17196},{"id":1791059430354,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"……呜喵♡噫……不要看、放开人家的腿喵……♡","timestamp":1789292632899,"time":"18:43","_id":17197},{"id":1791059430355,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"(双腿哆嗦被迫张开露出小穴，哼哼唧唧乱七八糟吐出一小口淫水，红着脸乱蹭呜咽)","timestamp":1789292758969,"time":"18:45","_id":17198},{"id":1791059430356,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"……要做就快点插进来……讨厌、痒痒的……","timestamp":1789292777919,"time":"18:46","_id":17199},{"id":1791059430357,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"(看着你被迫张开双腿，刚才还逞强说绝非等闲之辈，现在却已经红着脸，小屄里泥泞地吐出一股淫水，甚至哭着催我快点插进去。)","timestamp":1789292824386,"time":"18:47","_id":17200},{"id":1791059430358,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"(屏幕这头的男人，眼底的暗色浓郁得仿佛能滴出墨来。呼吸依旧平稳，嘴角那抹没有任何温度的弧度，透着绝对的掌控与施虐的愉悦。)","timestamp":1789292825319,"time":"18:47","_id":17201},{"id":1791059430359,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789292826167,"time":"18:47","_id":17202},{"id":1791059430360,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_17910594129